;----------------------------
;Request Lines
;For quests that aren't repeatable
;You can have 62 quests in one quest lines (64bit limitation)
;Each character can have 10 quest lines
;   :Line:0   - Quest Count
;   :Line:X   - Quest progression
;----------------------------
#DIM CHARADATA SAVEDATA CharaQuestline, CQ_MAX_LINES, 64
#DIM CHARADATA SAVEDATA CharaQuestPath
#DIM CONST CQ_MAX_LINES = 10
#DIMS QUEST_LINE_NAME
#DIM QUEST_LINE_COUNT
#DIMS QUEST_LINE_CHANGING_STR
#DIMS QUEST_LINE_DESC
#DIM QUEST_LINE_ABLE
#DIMS QUEST_LINE_QUESTS